  _headline: Data centers chegam com impostos e muita sede
  _headlineEn: Data centers arrive with taxes and a big thirst
  _body: "Trazem investimento, mas gastam eletricidade e \xE1gua para resfriar. O
    galp\xE3o novo n\xE3o dorme, e o medidor tamb\xE9m n\xE3o."
  _bodyEn: They bring investment, but burn power and water for cooling. The new building
    never sleeps, and neither does the meter.
